                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "ICYMI: I joined Planned Parenthood to speak out against drastic health care funding cuts that will leave thousands in our community without access to services they need to thrive.\n\u00a0\nHistoric cuts to health care will mean the closure of Planned Parenthood\u2019s primary care services in SoCal over the next few months, impacting over 13,000 Orange County patients. If Congress doesn\u2019t act to protect affordable health care, California families could be priced out of their health insurance entirely \u2014 making it even more difficult for folks to access the care they need. Proud to stand with Planned Parenthood to demand Congress act to improve health care access for our community.",
                "text_lang": "en",
