                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today, I joined my colleagues on the steps of the Capitol to fight for the affordable health care every American deserves.\u00a0\n\u00a0\nI was proud to share Peter and Esther's story. They are facing rising costs and bureaucratic red tape that threaten their access to essential medical care. And they\u2019re not alone \u2013 thousands of people across Southern California are being priced out of the care they need to thrive. I\u2019ll keep fighting to end this health care crisis.",
